13:     - Each marked row has exactly two foreground pixels, one at each horizontal boundary.
14:     Rule
15:     - Copy the grid.
16:     - For every marked row, compare the two boundary marker colors.
17:     - If the marker colors match, paint the whole row with that color; otherwise leave the row unchanged.
18:     Key insight
19:     - The two edge markers are a row-level equality test; matching endpoints authorize a full-width horizontal bar.
20:     """
